# Without this, the host's bin/ and obj/ are copied into the build context and
# `dotnet publish --no-restore` reuses a project.assets.json that points at
# Windows-only package folders, failing with a confusing ResolvePackageAssets
# error inside the container.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.claude/

# Secrets and local state never belong in an image.
.env
.env.local
certs/*.pfx
certs/*.pem
certs/*.key

**/*.md
docs/
